@startuml Box Replacement

title An attested box must change: it is replaced, never edited
caption Target design. Decisions D3, X3, D13. ADRs 0011, 0004, 0005.

autonumber

actor Loader as loader
actor Administrator as admin
participant "Freedom API" as api
database "Freedom database" as db

loader -> api : edit attested box
api --> loader : 409, an attested box is never edited
loader -> api : delete attested box
api --> loader : 409, an attested box is never deleted

loader -> api : POST /boxes/{id}/replace
group one transaction
  api -> db : void the old box (VoidedAt)
  api -> db : revoke its QR code
  api -> db : create the replacement, ReplacesBoxId = old\ncopy items (category, value, donor, expiry)
  api -> db : move the old box's vehicle allocation, if any
end
api --> loader : replacement created, **unattested**

note over api, db
  The old QR label no longer resolves.
  Voided boxes are excluded from weights, values, reports and declarations.
end note

loader -> api : correct the replacement's items, then validate it
api -> db : ValidatedBy, ValidatedAt
loader -> api : issue a new QR code, print the label

alt the box was on an approved vehicle load
  api -> db : manifest back to Proposed (X3)
  note right : the Administrator must re-approve the load
  admin -> api : approve manifest
  note over api
    The vehicle's declarations are now stale (the load
    differs from their snapshot). See the re-declare flow.
  end note
end

@enduml
